            "detailed_description": "<strong>Causality is a puzzle game about manipulating time, altering the sequence of events and changing the outcome of each level.</strong><br><br>Set across strange and alien landscapes, help a group of stranded astronauts find a route to safety. Travel through time, work with your past selves and solve paradoxes as you take on this uniquely challenging puzzler.<br><br>Each level represents a brief but hazardous moment in time. Levels are completed by guiding each astronaut to an exit that matches their colour, within a limited time frame. When all astronauts reach an exit the level is complete.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Control time and alter the outcome of each level<br></li><li>Work with your past selves to solve puzzles<br></li><li>60 Levels to complete<br></li><li>13 achievements to unlock</li></ul>",
